                    "c": "#CF6CB9",
                    "iy": 234,
                    "title": "File Preparation",
                    "text": "After that, artwork will be prepared, where we will be checking image quality and resolution, fonts used, bleed settings, profiles used, etc., and also overprinting and trapping will be checked; layout is also checked."
                },
                {
                    "no": "03",
                    "bg": "#FAF6EF",
                    "c": "#C9AC61",
                    "iy": 263.23,
                    "title": "Proofing & Quality Checks",
                    "text": "Digital proofs & pre-flights: they run a check for color(s), alignment(s), and typos and check for any technical problem(s) & omissions (the ‘pre’ phase for pre-press)."
